OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FFog and mist generally lift,
OL,6,Fthough it may linger all day in
OL,7,Fplaces, leaving a dry and bright day
OL,8,Felsewhere. Winds remaining light and
OL,9,Ffeeling rather mild especially where
OL,10,Ffog clears, cooler under lingering fog.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FRemaining dry this evening
OL,13,Fand into the night with clear spells.
OL,14,FMist and fog forming through the early
OL,15,Fhours across most of the region. A
OL,16,Fchilly night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
