OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FMist and fog gradually lift,
OL,6,Fbefore a band of low cloud and patchy
OL,7,Frain moves south through the day,
OL,8,Fclearing by late evening. Light winds
OL,9,Fand temperatures near normal.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,12,FLargely fine and settled with high
OL,13,Fpressure in charge. Cloudier on
OL,14,FTuesday with a few showers around.
OL,15,FTemperatures near average but feeling
OL,16,Fchilly overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
